@* MainLayout wraps every page. The default Blazor WASM template gives you a
   left-hand nav sidebar (for a multi-page app with a Home/Counter/Weather
   menu). CalcSaMD only ever has one page, so that sidebar is removed here
   rather than kept and left pointing at pages that don't exist — Phase 1's
   solution intentionally deletes Pages/Counter.razor and Pages/Weather.razor
   (see the Part 7 write-up in the plan document for why, and what the
   default template originally contained). *@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="page">
    <main>
        <article class="content px-4">
            @Body
        </article>
    </main>
</div>
